<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/P 133 0 R
/T (Despite lacking a background in Computer Science, ColorStack is where I found a community I grew to love. Initially, I joined with the intent of just trying something new. However, every event I attended added to my sense of welcome and belonging to a bigger community. The leadership of ColorStack were people I looked up to, whether it was for career or even life advice. I saw them as people I could trust, learn from, and rely on. As I serve this year as president, I hope my e-board and I can provide the same support to our members that was provided to me. )
/E (Despite lacking a background in Computer Science, ColorStack is where I found a community I grew to love. Initially, I joined with the intent of just trying something new. However, every event I attended added to my sense of welcome and belonging to a bigger community. The leadership of ColorStack were people I looked up to, whether it was for career or even life advice. I saw them as people I could trust, learn from, and rely on. As I serve this year as president, I hope my e-board and I can provide the same support to our members that was provided to me. )
/Pg 14 0 R
/K [0]
>>
